WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.100
<i>In elementary school,</i>

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.820
<i>I played the red oni in 
"The Red Oni Who Cried."</i>

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:10.030
<b>This house belongs
 to a nice oni.
Please come in.</b>

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.920
<i>The red oni is sad because
he can't make human friends.</i>

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.030
<i>But his friend, the blue oni, says to him...</i>

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.480
I'll go to the human village
and make a big fuss!

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.490
Then you can come and beat me up!

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.120
<i>And so the red oni becomes
friends with the humans,</i>

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.820
<i>but the blue oni vanishes.</i>

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.790
<i>When the red oni goes
 to his house, he realizes...</i>

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.790
<b>Blue</b>

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:28.250
<b>Dear Blue Oni,
I hope you can be good
 friends with the humans.
 If I'm with you, they might
 think that you're a bad 
oni, too. Goodbye.
 I'll always be your friend. 
-The Red Oni</b>

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.500
<i>The blue oni left so that
he wouldn't get in trouble.</i>

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.460
<i>And the red oni cries.</i>

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:52.330
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:06.480
Anyone have ideas about what we 
should do for the culture festival?

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.230
<b><i>Delusion 6</i></b>

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.610
Livestream us playing the game I made,
 "Married Wives 24 Hours"!

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:12.790
A performance by Sturmhut, 
knight of light and darkness...

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.100
"The Price Paid for the Light."

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.190
The play, "The Red Oni Who Cried."

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.020
<i>Who would want to see any of that?</i>

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.500
<i>Those are all...</i>

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:25.210
<i>There's someone suspicious in our class.</i>

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.120
Hey, what's wrong, Koyuki?

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.040
So we meet again...

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.750
Do you remember me?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:36.510
Calm down, Koyuki!

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:42.220
Mogami Kimikage

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:39.380
This is the new student,
Mogami Kimikage-kun.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.230
I forgot, you were out sick 
when he transferred in.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:46.200
He says you were friends
in elementary school.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.080
<i>I don't know him.</i>

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.560
<i>I don't know anyone that scary!</i>

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:49.810
<i>Who the heck is he?</i>

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.130
<i>Why was he waving a sword at me?</i>

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:53.020
<i>Why isn't the teacher saying anything?</i>

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.200
<i>What's wrong with this school?</i>

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.960
<i>What's wrong with my life?</i>

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.940
<i>None of this makes sense!</i>

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.940
It's been too long, Koyukichi-dono.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.580
Koyukichi-kun!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.700
My name's Koyuki.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.520
Koyuki... chi-kun.

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:09.870
<i>Wait, is that...</i>

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.210
Hey, you said you're an old
friend of Gestöber's, right?

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.580
Who are you? You're very strange.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:17.680
<i>Look who's talking.</i>

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.420
Hey, is that the new kid?

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.080
Wow, he's nuts.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.810
For real...

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.460
<i>Huh?</i>

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.430
<i>He cares what other people think of him?</i>

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:26.730
<i>Despite that outfit...</i>

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.160
How embarrassing.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.200
My mask has bedhead.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.510
<i>That's not the problem here!
Also, you sleep with that on?!</i>

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:36.220
<i>Actually, I guess he used to be like that...</i>

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.690
<i>Maybe it really is him.</i>

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:41.700
A transfer student in the same class,
and he turns out to be an old friend!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:42.740
Sounds like fate, huh?

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:46.960
My sister attends this school
 and said she saw you.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.960
So I transferred immediately.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.770
<i>He followed me here?</i>

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.290
<i>Why?</i>

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:56.000
I, the red oni, have sinned.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.560
I have come to be judged

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:03.100
so that I may be slain by my 
blue oni, Koyukichi-dono.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.700
Oh, that's right!

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.430
I have to go now!

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.510
Koyukichi-dono!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:12.900
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:15.000
<i>He didn't used to be like this!</i>

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.200
<i>He's turned into a total weirdo!</i>

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:21.120
<i>And what was that about sin? 
I don't remember him doing anything...</i>

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.680
Mogami's playing with ohajiki?

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:26.780
That's so lame.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.160
Wow, I've never even seen them before!

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.190
You don't even have any video games?

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.620
Are you poor?

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:37.080
I'll get yelled at if I lose them,
so I put them away,

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.440
but I actually have ivory ohajiki!

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.340
That's what you were worried about?

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.980
Teach me to play ohajiki sometime.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:44.680
Okay.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.800
<i>He was quiet and kind of oddly shy,</i>

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.150
<i>and we weren't especially close,</i>

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:51.080
<i>but sometimes we had moments like that.</i>

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.280
<i>I transferred and never 
saw him again, though.</i>

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.540
<i>What's all this oni stuff about?</i>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.310
Slay me with this katana, Koyukichi-dono!

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:03.700
<i>Don't talk to me from the next stall!</i>

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.650
Koyukichi-dono! Koyukichi-dono!

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:05.910
<i>H-Hey! Watch it! 
That's dangerous! Really dangerous!</i>

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.120
Koyukichi-dono! Koyu—

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.110
Why?

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.960
I'm sorry, but I don't remember.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.160
Did something that bad happen?

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:19.960
It was in our school's bathroom that 
I took advantage of your kindness

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.340
and became an oni warrior.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.880
<i>Your memories are of the bathroom?</i>

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.480
What's wrong, Mogami-kun?

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:29.660
I-I forgot we had a urine test today,
 and I already went!

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:32.220
What do I do? Everyone will
think I don't know how to pee!

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.060
No, they won't.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.640
You can have mine.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.640
<b>Class 2-3

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.640
<b>Urine Test</b>

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.350
Don't worry. I know a way to make this work.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.720
Yet disaster struck the very next day.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.900
You were told that your test
results didn't make sense,

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:50.490
and you broke down crying.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:54.980
I'd wondered if perhaps your plan involved
 the dog that lived behind the school,

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:57.200
but I couldn't bring myself to speak up.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.240
A month after that, you transferred schools...

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:05.940
Just like the blue oni who went 
far away to spare his friend, right?

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:09.020
No... I was the real oni.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.330
<i>No way!</i>

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.310
<i>I wouldn't do something that stupid!</i>

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.930
<i>Please stop! If someone hears that...</i>

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.510
<i>What are you doing in the bathroom?!</i>

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:23.270
Gestöber, you got a dog to piss in a cup?

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:26.360
<i>No! And you're the last person 
I want laughing at me!</i>

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.310
My stomach hurts...

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.950
<i>I'll hurt more than your stomach!</i>

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:35.420
Either way, it's clear that you 
left in shame because of me.

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:39.500
I want you to avenge your pain by killing me!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.280
<i>No... I'd forgotten all about that,</i>

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:45.580
<i>so the only thing that pains 
me is you bringing it up!</i>

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:45.380
<b>Slash</b>

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:46.520
Here.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.120
<i>Don't give me your sword! 
And don't open my stall!</i>

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.170
Goodness... Really?

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:55.700
You're telling me you think
Gestöber hates you,

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:59.110
and you're doing all this nonsense
to absolve yourself of guilt?

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:03.070
<i>Uh, can we please not talk
about this in my bathroom stall?</i>

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:06.670
And you're not even thinking about how
 this makes things harder for Gestöber?

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.140
How selfish.

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:09.360
<i>That goes for you, too!</i>

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.160
And what kind of character 
are you supposed to be?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.400
Aren't you a bit old for this?

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.330
<i>Are you being serious right now?</i>

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:18.400
So the likes of you would oppose me?

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.830
Ignorant fool!

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.260
Listen well.

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:27.730
Only a coward would seek to assuage their
guilt by forcing another to punish them.

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:32.360
If you lack the courage to face the oni within
your heart every day for the rest of your life,

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.790
then you're not worthy of that mask!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:44.860
You dare touch my soul?

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:49.500
What do you know?

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.940
You know nothing of me!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.720
Hey, it was a joke!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.780
<i>Hello, god of destruction?!</i>

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:58.800
What gives you the right to 
judge my dearest memories

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.750
when you don't know a thing about me?

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:05.270
<i>I think something like this
 happened once before...</i>

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:09.640
<i>Mogami-kun made a badge or something, 
and people made fun of him.</i>

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:13.410
<i>What did I do then?</i>

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.980
I'm sorry I forgot, Mogami-kun!

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.190
But I remember now!

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:21.820
I'm not mad!

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.700
It was my decision to do it!

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:26.500
And I only changed schools because 
my dad got transferred at work!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.780
So just stop this already!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.070
I was so happy...

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.440
When I said ridiculous things,

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:41.830
you were the only one who
would tell me I was wrong.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.070
I was so sure you hated me.

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:46.880
And I was so sad, so miserable...

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.080
I wore the mask because
I couldn't bear to face you.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:54.630
I wanted you to defeat this evil oni.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:58.020
You're a friend. I couldn't do that.

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.840
Koyukichi-dono...

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:01.930
It's "Koyuki," okay?

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.640
B-But I wouldn't feel right if you didn't!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.930
I-It's fine, really. 
It was a misunderstanding.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:09.690
Th-Then you can just tie me up with this rope

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.540
and throw me out in the cold!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.320
Why would I do that?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.900
Then just insult me!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:18.870
<b>Please</b>

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:18.870
<b>Please</b>

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:18.870
<b>Please</b>

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:18.480
Call me an oni! A devil! A pig!
Or you can just hit me!

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.700
Please punish me!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.700
<b>Stomp Stomp Stomp</b>

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.700
<b>Stomp Stomp</b>

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.700
You're just a pervert!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.620
<b>S H O C K</b>

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.280
I-I'm sorry, Mogami-kun! I...

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.970
That's just what I wanted, Koyukichi-dono.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.680
<b>Gasp</b>

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:36.880
<i>"Just because someone was once a friend</i>

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:42.140
<i>doesn't mean you can still open up
to them today." Koyukichi.</i>

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.100
Koyukichi-dono!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.820
Please punish me!

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:48.560
Just a little! Just a little will do!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.460
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:52.520
<i>I knew from the start that
I shouldn't get involved!</i>

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:58.260
Mogami-kun used to love it so much 
when Seri-kun yelled at him

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:02.100
that he still hasn't forgotten 
it after all these years.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:04.540
It's so nice to have shared memories.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:08.620
Seri-kun doesn't remember his last life
when the two of you were together.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.250
Mogami Kimikage...

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:13.270
The hell-bound object of my
vengeance from my last life!

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.610
Koyukichi-dono!

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:15.210
Possibly.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.160
Hey, you!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:37.080
You're bugging Gestöber again!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.530
And what about you?

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.700
You're not even Koyukichi-dono's friend.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.410
Gestöber carries a great destiny:

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.280
to fight by my side to maintain
the balance of this world.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.610
You're still going on about that?

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:51.260
It's time for you to outgrow 
the world of beeps and boops.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:52.280
Beeps and boops?

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.620
I mean video games.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.360
Video games?!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.930
Gestöber, he's being mean!

00:10:57.930 --> 00:11:00.490
Don't go whining to Koyukichi-dono
any time something happens.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:02.990
<i>I'm starting to think I may 
never know peace again...</i>

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:01.860
You're the whiner!

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:02.720
I am not.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:03.410
You are!

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:05.660
It's like that tale about the 
sun and the north wind, huh?

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.100
Am not.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:04.720
Are too!

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:05.330
Am not.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:05.660
Are—

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.250
You're the traveler, Seri-kun.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.760
And those two are the sun and the wind,

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.460
fighting to see who can take off your coat...

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:14.140
who can break down the walls of your heart!

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:15.600
Fighting?

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:18.070
I know who'd win in a real fight.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:21.870
I've been by his side from 
our past life to our class trip!

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:26.680
Nonsense. You haven't even
exchanged urine samples.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:29.460
If you want to surrender, now's the time.

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:33.670
I'll be the one who gets
 a play date with Koyukichi-dono!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:33.670
I'll be the one who gets 
a play date with Gestöber!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:34.870
<i>Are we in preschool?!</i>

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:36.230
<i>What's this about play dates?</i>

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:38.010
<i>You never even asked to hang out!</i>

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.740
<i>Why did you two suddenly turn 
into Ushiwakamaru and Benkei?</i>

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:43.630
<i>If you want to hang out,
 then hang out with yourselves!</i>

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:44.520
<i>Damn it all!</i>

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:47.850
<i>I told myself today was going to 
be the day I didn't yell at anyone!</i>

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.000
Accept yourself for who you are, Seri-kun.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.400
<i>Shut up, you snickering asshole!</i>

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.110
<i>I hate you!</i>

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:57.060
They're always so annoying.

00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:00.400
<i>I'm never raising my voice again.</i>

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.880
<i>I won't give up on peaceful days.</i>

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.880
<i>I will achieve a state of emptiness.</i>

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:07.830
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:15.390
A wonderful performance, Koyukichi-dono!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.620
I'm so jealous...

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:20.340
If I were a timpani, you'd strike me, too.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:23.310
<i>Won't. Say. A. Word.</i>

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.120
I'm with the student council.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:27.190
Who's the festival rep for this class?

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:28.480
Oh, that's me.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.410
Has your class decided what it's doing?

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:31.600
No, not yet.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.260
Well, hurry it up.

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.170
<i>That's right.</i>

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.180
<i>I was so distracted by all this...
What should we do?</i>

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:38.310
Gestöber, why don't we put on a performance?

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:39.370
Perhaps a musical?

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:40.810
<i>What's with you? You're creeping me out.</i>

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:41.980
What's wrong with you?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:45.860
Were you jealous of my and
 Koyukichi-dono's performance?

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.870
Anything music-related is taboo
around Koyukichi-dono.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.880
What?

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:53.640
It happened when I was teaching
him how to finger on a recorder.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:58.080
He hurt his tiny fingers 
trying to spread them too far,

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:59.720
but didn't know what had happened...

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:02.800
It hurts! I've been cursed!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.990
...and he burst into tears.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:05.290
Shut up!

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:09.020
So we mustn't bring back
memories of that trauma.

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:09.880
<i></i>You're<i> my trauma!</i>

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:13.100
And I have the right to be punished.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.600
<i>Well, I'm not obliged to do it!</i>

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.140
Cursed? Gestöber, you dork!

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.850
<i>That's enough from you!</i>

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.580
Sensei, I'll play the piano.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.070
Okay.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.890
This is Chopin's "Revolutionary Étude."

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.070
<i>Chopping!</i>

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.830
"Ch-Chopping" is too funny, Gestöber!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.540
<i>Stop teasing me!</i>

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.500
<i>This is the worst.</i>

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:35.940
<i>I have to figure out what 
we're doing for the festival,</i>

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:38.160
<i>but I'm not feeling so hot...</i>

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:40.090
I, Hanadori Kabuto, will sing.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:43.900
I swore that I would never
sing with Dead Bull again,

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:46.290
but I will sing for my partner, Gestöber.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.540
<i>Nope. Not interested.</i>

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.260
Please, listen to my aria!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:14.660
<i>He has the voice of an angel?!</i>

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.620
<i>Hanadori-kun, why be a god of destruction?</i>

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:18.740
<i>Go back to Dead Bull!</i>

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:23.210
I-I hope that brings at least some
peace to Gestöber's heart...

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.900
<i>The opposite, actually.</i>

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:31.560
Widdlekins, the little black kitty,

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:35.700
goes meow, meow, meow in my lap...

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:36.850
<i>What's with the sudden change?</i>

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.030
He licks my face, too!

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:41.040
Mew, mew, mew!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.730
<i>The hell? Do you think that's cute?</i>

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:45.060
And he licks my fingers too, meow!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.010
<i>Don't look at me!</i>

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.900
<i>What exactly do you want us to do now?</i>

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.470
Did I break down the walls
 of your heart, meow?

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:51.660
<i>They're thicker than ever!</i>

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.300
<i>Everyone's looking at me like,</i>

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:56.010
<i>"He's your friend, right? Do something!"</i>

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.320
Meow!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.250
<i>Go back to being a dark god
 of destruction already!</i>

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.710
Did you decide what you're doing?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.000
<i>Hell no!</i>

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.170
Kabu-dono.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.340
Cats are taboo around Koyukichi-dono.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:14.650
<i>How many dark stories
from my past do you know?!</i>

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:13.720
Koyukichi-dono has this stuffed
cat that's very dear to him.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.180
He got it for me, but he sleeps
with it every night, and...

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.720
I'm going home.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:29.360
<i>This was the day I, Koyuki Seri, abandoned
 my personal war to never yell at anyone.</i>

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:35.020
I'm Shirayuki Seri from Mitoya High.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:36.490
<b>Shirayuki Seri</b>

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.490
Nice to meet you all.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.940
I'm Kuromiya-kun!

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:39.450
I am Kurokage.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.500
Am I late?

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:44.960
This animal spoke to me, Kurodori Kabuto...

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.880
A dream? Oh, man...

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.840
It's time for an emergency meeting.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.180
Who killed Seri-kun?

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.810
I'm the one who pushed him to the brink.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.220
It's my fault.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.520
It's my fault!

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.650
In a way, everyone became the north wind

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.620
and closed off Seri-kun's heart.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:10.480
So who here can be our sun?

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.830
Package for Koyuki-san!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.000
<i>Don't tell me... Hibiki-kun?</i>

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:24.170
<i>"I sent you this to help you feel
better, Gestöber-senpai!"</i>

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.000
<i>What is this?</i>

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.120
<i>Is an underclassman playing a prank on me?</i>

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:29.280
<i>"It's a skull-shaped incense burner!</i>

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.990
<i>My way of telling you to rest..."</i>

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.080
<i>Rest in peace?!</i>

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:35.550
<i>This is no good.</i>

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.840
<i>I'm feeling like the whole
world is out to get me.</i>

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.210
<i>N-Nyanteko!</i>

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.160
<i>Wh-What is that?</i>

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.100
<i>A arrow?</i>

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.020
<i>Who could have...</i>

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:49.440
It seems it reached you.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.280
<i>Mogami, you jerk!</i>

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:54.050
The sun watches over you indirectly.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:54.840
Farewell.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:57.570
<i>There was nothing "indirect" about that!</i>

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:00.160
<i>What is wrong with everyone?</i>

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.780
<i>"Koyukichi-dono,</i>

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:04.270
<i>I wove strands of my own 
hair into this straw doll.</i>

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.430
<i>It would give me the greatest pleasure if 
you'd pound a nail into it and shout at it..."</i>

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:10.180
<i>Even an indirect punishment like
that would make him happy?</i>

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:11.380
<i>He's a real pervert!</i>

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.350
<i>It's no use...</i>

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:16.260
<i>I can leave school, but I still
can't get away from them.</i>

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.500
Give it up, Seri-kun.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.550
Give it up, Seri-kun!

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.180
<i>Tsukimiya-kun's voice?!</i>

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:23.550
<i>Impossible...</i>

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:25.510
<i>It's like I can hear him in my head!</i>

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:26.880
<i>Is he God?</i>

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.130
<i>"Give it up"?</i>

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:31.340
<i>Is he telling me I should
 accept them and just laugh?</i>

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:31.880
That's right.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:32.780
<i>God?!</i>

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.850
<i>No, no, no... I'm imagining things.</i>

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:39.730
<i>But if the two of them are around, then...</i>

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.780
<i>So is he!</i>

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:44.520
<i>What's he going to do to me?!</i>

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:47.110
<i>Why am I the only one who
has to deal with this?!</i>

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:48.440
Seri, you have a guest.

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:52.300
<i>No!</i>

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.730
Your friend came all this way to see you.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:55.920
The guy in the eyepatch, right?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:59.470
He's not my friend! He's a god of destruction!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:59.460
No!

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.720
It's the girl who came by over the summer.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:06.690
How are you feeling, Koyuki-kun?

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.650
I'm sorry for coming over
 without asking first.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.800
Am I bothering you?

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.620
N-Not at all!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:15.290
Thanks for coming.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.210
That kitty's so cute!

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.280
Oh, yeah, that's...

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.080
I've had it since I was a kid.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.520
Weird, right?

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:26.740
I'm in high school now...

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:30.870
Widdlekins, the little black kitty,

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:35.170
goes meow, meow, meow in my lap...

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.340
Do you know that song?

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:40.220
It's from a children's show.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:44.180
My class is going to sing it 
and do a dance at the festival.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.900
R-Really?!

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:48.120
We'll be wearing cat ears and everything.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.360
<i>Cat ears?! Sumiso-san in cat ears!</i>

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.850
Kind of embarrassing, huh?

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.400
Will you come see us?

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.100
Yes! I will!

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:58.320
It was Tsukimiya-kun who 
told me where you were.

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:03.320
I knew you were fighting something...

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.620
But he said you'd gotten kind of exhausted.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.840
<i>I-It's true that I'm fighting my 
hardest not to yell at anyone...</i>

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.540
I'm with you, Koyuki-kun!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.790
I want to be on your side!

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:18.210
Sumiso-san...

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:21.540
<i>You're my sun!</i>

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:24.380
A-Are you okay, Koyuki-kun?

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:25.680
I'm just great.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.230
Thank you, Sumiso-san!

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:30.260
<i>But I abandoned it all.</i>

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.940
<i>Even the work I was supposed to do...</i>

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.100
<b>Culture Festival</b>

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.400
It'll be fine, okay?

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:41.950
Get to it.

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:42.900
Gestöber!

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:44.890
A-Are you feeling better?

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:45.580
<i>You know...</i>

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:50.540
<i>Hanadori-kun says he's going to handle
all of the work you were supposed to do.</i>

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:53.080
<i>You really are comrades in arms, huh?</i>

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.840
<i>No, he's my sworn enemy.</i>

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:59.220
You really were doing a lot, huh, Koyuki-kun?

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:01.310
Sorry. We didn't realize
how hard it was on you.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.900
<i>Everyone was helping him...</i>

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:08.990
When I said to give it up,

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:12.980
I meant to stop trying to take 
things on all by yourself.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:17.440
I didn't realize how hard it was for you 
to bring the whole class together.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:20.060
And I asked you to shoulder 
the fate of the world, too.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.990
Gestöber, I'm sorry.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.150
<i>Hanadori-kun...</i>

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:25.290
From now on, let's make sure we focus

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:28.340
on our school life as much as 
we focus on saving the world!

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:29.370
<i>No, that's not right.</i>

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.400
So, did we decide what we're
doing for the culture festival?

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:34.290
Who's the festival rep for this class again?

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:36.020
Oh... Here.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:39.240
The student council approved your proposal.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.110
I see.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:42.310
We'll go with that, then.

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:43.370
What about the cooking?

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:46.090
We're working to schedule
the inspections for the kitchen.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:46.900
Roger that.

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:48.620
Glad to hear you're on top of it.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.810
Hanadori, will this work
for the budget allocation?

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.320
We should assume the 
kitchen team will need more.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:56.740
Let's keep some money in reserve
in case something comes up.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:57.880
Got it.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:59.100
Oh, right.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:01.230
I took notes for you while you were gone.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.880
They're yours if you need them.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:08.070
Hanadori, you did a great job 
with all that extra work.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.340
But of course!

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:11.280
I was filling in for Gestöber!

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:13.490
G-Gestöber...

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:15.870
I may not be as smart as you,
 but let's both—

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.590
Are you messing with me?!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:18.860
This is the problem!

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:22.010
The fact that you're like this
is what makes you so difficult!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.080
No! if you're going to hit someone, hit me!

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.600
Senpai, why are you hitting
him with my present?

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:27.810
Gestöber!

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:28.760
Koyukichi-dono!

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.730
You'll break the incense burner!

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:35.060
It's so much nicer when Seri-kun's around 
to keep all these masochists in line!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:39.570
Don't you dare sum up my role that way!

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:43.780
Japanese-style café

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:42.560
We took everyone's opinions 
into consideration and decided

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:45.440
on two things: a Japanese-style
café and a documentary entitled

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:48.740
"The Trial of Gestöber and the
 Dark Past of Sturmhut the Ninja."

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.660
Just no!

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:53.790
Why is everyone laughing?!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.490
Why is everyone picking on me?!

00:21:56.490 --> 00:21:59.590
You brought everyone together, Seri-kun!

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:01.960
I wish I hadn't!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:10.430
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:10.430
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:10.430
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:10.430
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:10.430
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:10.430
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:10.430
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:04.960
<i>Life is a nightmare,</i>

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:10.420
<i>and the only thing keeping me going is 
the hope of seeing Sumiso-san in cat ears.</i>

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:23.660
Huh? It's a cat costume and not cat ears?

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:25.000
That's right.

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:27.380
Let's get started.

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:28.820
Let's get to it!

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:30.760
Huh? What's with the video?

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:32.520
Sorry, it's just storyboards today.

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:35.020
What's going on here, Producer Hanadori?

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:37.580
My right eye!

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:39.520
Don't turn to darkness
to escape your screw-up!
